{%- comment -%}
  Prints a merchant setting, or a translated default from locales (voltix.*) when the setting is empty.
  This keeps English and Arabic copy in the locale files while still allowing edits in the theme editor.

  Accepts:
  - value {String}: the setting value
  - key {String}: locale key used when value is blank

  Usage:
  {% render 'voltix-text', value: section.settings.heading, key: 'voltix.cats_heading' %}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if value != blank -%}{{ value | escape }}{%- else -%}{{ key | t }}{%- endif -%}
